  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 1.04,
      "text": "What if Shikamaru got one"
    },
    {
      "start": 1.04,
      "end": 2.48,
      "text": "day to fix Konoha?"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.48,
      "end": 4.68,
      "text": "His opponent is administrative incompetence."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.68,
      "end": 5.88,
      "text": "Naruto's desk is buried in"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.88,
      "end": 6.74,
      "text": "requests."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.74,
      "end": 8.18,
      "text": "My guy, that's not leadership."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.18,
      "end": 9.34,
      "text": "That's indoor composting."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.34,
      "end": 10.56,
      "text": "Instead of bigger jutsu, he"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.56,
      "end": 11.7,
      "text": "asks why teams use one"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.7,
      "end": 12.48,
      "text": "gate together."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.48,
      "end": 14.26,
      "text": "Nobody coordinates departures."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.26,
      "end": 15.28,
      "text": "A whole ninja village got"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.28,
      "end": 16.7,
      "text": "outplayed by a calendar with"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.7,
      "end": 17.9,
      "text": "serious trust issues."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.9,
      "end": 19.24,
      "text": "He staggers departures and keeps"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.24,
      "end": 20.62,
      "text": "a reserve squad."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.62,
      "end": 22.54,
      "text": "Emergencies finally stop borrowing people"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.54,
      "end": 23.789999893794644,
      "text": "from other emergencies."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.789999893794644,
      "end": 25.37,
      "text": "Next, hospital supplies need approval"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.37,
      "end": 27.310000000000002,
      "text": "from somebody waiting for medicine."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.310000000000002,
      "end": 28.21,
      "text": "Beautiful."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.21,
      "end": 29.67,
      "text": "Bureaucracy learned recursion."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.67,
      "end": 30.73,
      "text": "A clear supply route fixes"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.73,
      "end": 31.73,
      "text": "the delay."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.73,
      "end": 33.15,
      "text": "Fewer injured people wait while"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.15,
      "end": 35.05,
      "text": "paperwork auditions for main character."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.05,
      "end": 36.93,
      "text": "Somebody says this looks boring."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.93,
      "end": 38.17,
      "text": "Motherflicker, we're building a functioning"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.17,
      "end": 39.629999999999995,
      "text": "village, not a trailer with"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.629999999999995,
      "end": 40.47,
      "text": "explosions."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.47,
      "end": 41.95,
      "text": "But plans don't explain everybody's"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.95,
      "end": 42.81,
      "text": "needs."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.81,
      "end": 44.129999999999995,
      "text": "Shikamaru has to listen instead"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.129999999999995,
      "end": 45.69771408170663,
      "text": "of treating people like puzzles."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.69771408170663,
      "end": 46.7776875,
      "text": "He changes the system after"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.7776875,
      "end": 47.7776875,
      "text": "hearing them."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.7776875,
      "end": 49.717687500000004,
      "text": "Smart doesn't mean automatically correct."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.717687500000004,
      "end": 51.5576875,
      "text": "By afternoon, things run smoother."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.5576875,
      "end": 52.457687500000006,
      "text": "He uses the saved time"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.457687500000006,
      "end": 53.3376875,
      "text": "for a nap."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.3376875,
      "end": 54.8776875,
      "text": "A coherent political platform."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.8776875,
      "end": 56.957687500000006,
      "text": "Naruto requests the secret technique."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.957687500000006,
      "end": 58.6376875,
      "text": "Shikamaru hands him a schedule."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.6376875,
      "end": 60.0776875,
      "text": "Decades training assassins, and they"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.0776875,
      "end": 60.9776875,
      "text": "forgot appointments."
    }
  ],
